# The image is built from the repository root (infra/Dockerfile compiles both
# services), so the build context is the whole repo. Everything the build
# produces for itself is excluded — sending a local node_modules or vendor
# would be slower than reinstalling them, and would let a stale local tree
# leak into an image that is supposed to be reproducible.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
services/api/vendor
services/api/var
services/builder/stage

.git
.github
.claude
.idea
.vscode

# Never bake secrets into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Documentation and planning: no bearing on what runs.
briefs
docs
knowledge
*.md
!services/builder/DEPLOY.md

**/*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
